  m_text: '<color=#E5A92F>Move:</color> Arrows / WASD / ZQSD      <color=#E5A92F>Attack:</color>
    Space


    Kill all the monsters and collect all the coins to open the way.

    Level
    1: push the rock to make a bridge, then find the key.

    Level 2: answer the
    question at the door and save the princess!

    A heart on the ground gives
    you back your 3 hearts.'
